# Repository-wide line-ending policy.
# Everything is stored and checked out with LF so diffs, golden tests and
# piped output stay byte-identical across Windows, Linux and macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files are the one exception: cmd.exe requires CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Never line-ending-normalize binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
